      "id": "claim_ee7e5f1ecab84656b513e7ea0865c868",
      "statement": "The MCP tool's text contract (the MCPServer instructions string at mcp_server.py lines 9-12 and the search_remote_jobs docstring at lines 33-35) names only four sources — RemoteOK, Himalayas, Remotive and Jobicy — but the underlying graph actually fans out to six, because agent.py's fan_out dispatches Send to fetch_wjobs (Workable) and fetch_gjobs (Getro) alongside the four named fetchers.",
