      "statement": "fetch_fresh caches the normalized job list (post-normalize_jobs, pre-filter_jobs) keyed by the stripped-and-lowercased query, so subsequent calls with different exclude_keywords filter the cached list locally without re-invoking the graph or re-hitting the job boards.",
