    {
      "id": "claim_bcb9c031fd98454e86a06b8708f2afb8",
      "statement": "search_remote_jobs is annotated readOnlyHint=True and takes exclude_keywords as an explicit per-call argument (defaulting to None, coerced to an empty list inside the body), making the calling client's conversation the memory for exclusion refinement instead of accumulated server-side thread state or an LLM feedback-extraction call.",
